notes.content:
Hello again! Thank you for playing ENDLESS MONDAY: DREAMS AND DEADLINES! Can you believe it's already been a month since the game launched? I've really been so happy with how many of you have played and enjoyed the game. Thank you thank you!!

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43474029/87babdb618af6e3bbbf9231494d9b8190167fcc0.png
If you've been waiting for the Mac release to play ENDLESS MONDAY: DREAMS AND DEADLINES, well I have good news for you! It's now available! On Mac! Why not install it on your work laptop and go on an adventure on the company dime? (Hint: Press the T key while in-game if your boss is nearby). This release also comes with a bunch of other smaller changes and features, so check out the patch notes for 1.0.7 if you're interested in that. 

This update involved some under the hood changes for future updates, so please let me know if you run into any weird issues you weren't seeing before.

Other Stuff
JP Localization is well under way! I've also made a lot of code changes under the hood to allow for translations to other languages, so that should be coming soon.

Check out the OST on Chance Thrash's bandcamp, why don't ya.

Stickers merch for Endless Monday is available on my shop! You know, in case you wanted to support the game and stick some cool stickers on your precious items while you're at it.

